---
import '../styles/prototype.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Shreyansh & Mrunalini</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amita:wght@400;700&amp;family=Tiro+Devanagari+Hindi:ital@0;1&amp;family=Tiro+Devanagari+Marathi:ital@0;1&amp;display=swap">
<noscript><style>#cover{display:none}</style></noscript>
<script is:inline>document.documentElement.classList.add('js');try{if(sessionStorage.getItem('sm-force-motion')==='1')document.documentElement.classList.add('force-motion')}catch(e){}</script>
</head>
<body>
<div class="selv l zari" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="selv r hatch" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div id="progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div id="akshata" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div id="cover" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cvTitle">
  <div class="cloth silk">
    <div class="tw-layer" id="cvTw" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hem"><div class="zb zari"></div><div class="mb"></div></div>
    <div class="cloth-body">
      <div class="cv-text cv-in cv-guest">
        <span class="cv-eyebrow"><span lang="hi">सस्नेह निमंत्रण</span> · with love, for</span>
        <span class="cal cv-guestname">the [Guest name] family</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-door cv-in">
        <svg class="cv-apex" viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 0 0 9 9 18Z" fill="#C9A04A"/><path d="M9 0 18 9 9 18Z" fill="#F5EFE3"/></svg>
      <div class="cv-text cv-in cv-center">
        <p lang="hi" class="cv-inv">॥ श्री गणेशाय नमः ॥</p>
        <div class="cv-mark" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="cv-rule l"></span>
          <svg class="swastik" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
            <path class="sw-disc" d="M50 4A46 46 0 0 0 50 96Z" fill="#F5EFE3"/>
            <path class="sw-disc" d="M50 4A46 46 0 0 1 50 96Z" fill="#EFE3C8"/>
            <path class="sw-hatch" d="M50 4A46 46 0 0 1 50 96" fill="none" stroke="#2B211B" stroke-width="4.4" stroke-dasharray="1.2 2.6"/>
            <path class="sw-ring" pathLength="1" d="M50 1.5A48.5 48.5 0 0 0 50 98.5" fill="none" stroke="#C9A04A" stroke-width="3"/>
            <path class="sw-ring" pathLength="1" d="M50 7A43 43 0 0 0 50 93" fill="none" stroke="#C9A04A" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            <path class="sw-ring" pathLength="1" d="M50 1.5A48.5 48.5 0 0 1 50 98.5" fill="none" stroke="#2B211B" stroke-width="1.8"/>
            <path class="sw-ring" pathLength="1" d="M50 7A43 43 0 0 1 50 93" fill="none" stroke="#2B211B" stroke-width="1.8"/>
            <g fill="none" stroke="#B3261E" stroke-width="5.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path class="sw-line" pathLength="1" d="M50 30V70"/>
              <path class="sw-line" pathLength="1" d="M30 50H70"/>
              <path class="sw-line" pathLength="1" d="M50 30H64"/>
              <path class="sw-line" pathLength="1" d="M70 50V64"/>
              <path class="sw-line" pathLength="1" d="M50 70H36"/>
              <path class="sw-line" pathLength="1" d="M30 50V36"/>
            </g>
            <g fill="#B3261E"><circle class="sw-dot" cx="39" cy="39" r="3.3"/><circle class="sw-dot" cx="61" cy="39" r="3.3"/><circle class="sw-dot" cx="61" cy="61" r="3.3"/><circle class="sw-dot" cx="39" cy="61" r="3.3"/></g>
          </svg>
          <span class="cv-rule r"></span>
        </div>
        <p id="cvTitle" class="cv-names">
          <span class="cal nm cv-nm">Shreyansh</span>
          <span class="cal amp cv-amp">&amp;</span>
          <span class="cal nm cv-nm">Mrunalini</span>
        </p>
        <span lang="hi" class="cal dn cv-dn">श्रेयांश · मृणालिनी</span>
        <span class="cv-date">8 &amp; 9 December 2026 · Ranchi</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cv-text cv-in cv-cta">
        <div class="seal-wrap">
          <span class="halo" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <button type="button" class="seal" id="openBtn">
            <span class="glint" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span lang="mr" class="cal big">शुभमंगल सावधान</span>
            <span class="small">Tap to open your invitation</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <span class="cv-why">At these words, the antarpat is lowered</span>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pallu" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mb"></div><div class="pl-motif" id="cvPallu"></div><div class="mb"></div><div class="zb zari"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="cv-toran cv-in" id="cvToran" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>

<nav id="moments" aria-label="Motion moments" hidden>
  <button type="button" id="momBtn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="momList">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M5 7h14M5 12h14M5 17h9"/></svg>Moments
  </button>
  <ol id="momList" hidden>
    <li class="mstat" id="mStat"></li>
    <li><a href="#hero"><b>1 · The names arrive</b><span>Letters rise one by one; feathers drift at different depths. Move your mouse on a laptop.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#ribbons"><b>2 · Two ribbons cross</b><span>Paithani gold and Madhubani paper cross; scroll faster and they race.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#meeting"><b>3 · The peacocks meet</b><span>Pinned scene: scroll slowly down, then back up.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#schedule"><b>4 · Haldi, Sangeet, Shaadi</b><span>Mango leaves dip into turmeric; the dholak beats and sa-re-ga-ma floats up (tap it); the knot is tied over the fire and seven diyas light.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#mangal"><b>5 · The blessing</b><span>The verse lights up word by word; gold specks drift; the zari glints.</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#rsvp"><b>6 · The curtain and RSVP</b><span>The RSVP slides over the countdown; send it and the akshata is tossed.</span></a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<main>
  <section id="hero" aria-labelledby="heroTitle">
    <div class="band"><div class="zari"></div><div class="hatch"></div></div>
    <div class="hero-top">
      <div class="half l silk"></div>
      <div class="half r paper"></div>
      <p lang="hi" class="invocation">॥ श्री गणेशाय नमः ॥</p>
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-side her">
          <span class="lbl">Paithani · from her Pune</span>
          <span class="cal nm letters wave">Mrunalini</span>
          <span lang="mr" class="cal dn write">मृणालिनी</span>
        </div>
        <div class="med" data-pose="apart"></div>
        <div class="hero-side his">
          <span class="lbl">Madhubani · from his Bihar</span>
          <span class="cal nm letters wave">Shreyansh</span>
          <span lang="hi" class="cal dn write">श्रेयांश</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="art-labels" aria-hidden="true"><span class="l">Paithani · <span lang="mr" class="cal">पैठणी</span></span><span>Madhubani · <span lang="hi" class="cal">मधुबनी</span></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-plate plate">
      <h1 id="heroTitle" tabindex="-1" class="cal nm" aria-label="Shreyansh and Mrunalini"><span class="letters wave" aria-hidden="true">Shreyansh</span> <span class="amp" aria-hidden="true">&amp;</span> <span class="letters wave" aria-hidden="true">Mrunalini</span></h1>
      <span lang="hi" class="cal dn"><span class="write">श्रेयांश · मृणालिनी</span></span>
      <span class="hero-date">Tuesday 8 &amp; Wednesday 9 December 2026 · Haveli Banquet, Ranchi</span>
    </div>
    <div class="floaters back" id="flBack" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="floaters front" id="flFront" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </section>

  <section id="ribbons" aria-label="Shubh vivah">
    <div class="ribbon rib-z"><div class="track" id="trackZ"></div></div>
    <div class="ribbon rib-m"><div class="track" id="trackM"></div></div>
  </section>

  <section id="meeting" aria-label="The two peacocks meet">
    <div class="stage">
      <div class="half l silk" id="mL"></div>
      <div class="half r paper" id="mR"></div>
      <div class="caps">
        <p class="cap"><span>They see each other. Keep scrolling.</span></p>
        <p class="cap"><span>Silk from her side, paper from his</span></p>
        <p class="cap"><span>Tails open, feather by feather</span></p>
        <p class="cap"><span>They meet, and the garland is exchanged</span></p>
      </div>
      <svg id="meetSvg" viewBox="0 0 400 300" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
      <div class="meet-names plate">
        <span class="cal nm write">Shreyansh <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Mrunalini</span>
        <span lang="hi" class="cal dn write">श्रेयांश · मृणालिनी</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="schedule" aria-labelledby="schedTitle">
    <div class="sched-head silk">
      <div class="toran" id="toran" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span lang="mr" class="mr">कार्यक्रम</span> · the celebrations</p>
      <h2 id="schedTitle" class="cal reveal">From Pune to Ranchi, <span>three celebrations</span></h2>
      <svg class="divider reveal" viewBox="0 0 220 16" width="200" height="15" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0 8H96" stroke="#C9A04A" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M124 6H220M124 10H220" stroke="#F5EFE3" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M110 0 101 8 110 16Z" fill="#C9A04A"/><path d="M110 0 119 8 110 16Z" fill="#F5EFE3"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="band"><div class="zari"></div><div class="hatch"></div></div>
    <div class="paper">
      <div class="wrap chapters">
        <article class="chapter" data-event="haldi">
          <div class="med" data-event="haldi"></div>
          <h3 class="cal letters wave">Haldi</h3>
          <div class="cal dn reveal"><span lang="mr">हळद</span> · <span lang="hi">हल्दी</span></div>
          <p class="story reveal" style="margin:0">Turmeric in a brass bowl, mango leaves and marigolds.</p>
          <dl class="reveal">
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Tuesday, 8 December 2026 · 12 noon</dd>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Haveli Banquet, Ranchi</dd>
            <dt>Wear</dt><dd><span class="swatch" style="background:#D99A1E;--edge:#E8C06A"></span>Yellow, in turmeric shades</dd>
          </dl>
          <div class="rites reveal">
            <a class="rite" data-rite="way" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Haveli+Banquet+Ranchi" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Find your way to Haveli Banquet, Ranchi (opens Google Maps)">
              <span class="rite-ic"></span><b lang="mr">रस्ता दाखवा</b><i>Find your way to us</i>
            </a>
            <a class="rite" data-rite="knot" data-cal="haldi" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Save the Haldi date to your calendar">
              <span class="rite-ic"></span><b lang="hi">गाँठ बाँध लीजिए</b><i>Save the date</i>
            </a>
          </div>
          <svg class="threads" viewBox="0 0 60 130" width="60" height="130" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M30 0C54 22 6 44 30 65S6 108 30 130" fill="none" stroke="#C9A04A" stroke-width="3"/><path pathLength="1" d="M30 0C6 22 54 44 30 65S54 108 30 130" fill="none" stroke="#2B211B" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
        </article>
        <article class="chapter" data-event="sangeet">
          <button type="button" class="med medbtn" data-event="sangeet" aria-label="Play the dholak"></button>
          <h3 class="cal letters wave">Sangeet</h3>
          <div class="cal dn reveal"><span lang="mr">संगीत</span> · <span lang="hi">संगीत संध्या</span></div>
          <p class="story reveal" style="margin:0">The dholak plays and the ghungroo answer.</p>
          <dl class="reveal">
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Tuesday, 8 December 2026 · 8 in the evening</dd>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Haveli Banquet, Ranchi</dd>
            <dt>Wear</dt><dd><span class="swatch" style="background:#2F3E73;--edge:#C9A04A"></span>Evening formals; Indo-western welcome</dd>
          </dl>
          <div class="rites reveal">
            <a class="rite" data-rite="way" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Haveli+Banquet+Ranchi" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Find your way to Haveli Banquet, Ranchi (opens Google Maps)">
              <span class="rite-ic"></span><b lang="mr">रस्ता दाखवा</b><i>Find your way to us</i>
            </a>
            <a class="rite" data-rite="knot" data-cal="sangeet" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Save the Sangeet date to your calendar">
              <span class="rite-ic"></span><b lang="hi">गाँठ बाँध लीजिए</b><i>Save the date</i>
            </a>
          </div>
          <svg class="threads" viewBox="0 0 60 130" width="60" height="130" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M30 0C54 22 6 44 30 65S6 108 30 130" fill="none" stroke="#C9A04A" stroke-width="3"/><path pathLength="1" d="M30 0C6 22 54 44 30 65S54 108 30 130" fill="none" stroke="#2B211B" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
        </article>
        <article class="chapter" data-event="shaadi">
          <div class="med" data-event="shaadi"></div>
          <h3 class="cal letters wave">Shaadi</h3>
          <div class="cal dn reveal"><span lang="mr">लग्न</span> · <span lang="hi">शुभ विवाह</span></div>
          <p class="story reveal" style="margin:0">Seven steps around the fire; the knot is tied.</p>
          <dl class="reveal">
            <dt>When</dt><dd>Wednesday, 9 December 2026 · 8 in the evening</dd>
            <dt>Where</dt><dd>Haveli Banquet, Ranchi</dd>
            <dt>Wear</dt><dd><span class="swatch" style="background:#A3195B;--edge:#C9A04A"></span>Traditional finery, in jewel tones</dd>
          </dl>
          <div class="rites reveal">
            <a class="rite" data-rite="way" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Haveli+Banquet+Ranchi" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Find your way to Haveli Banquet, Ranchi (opens Google Maps)">
              <span class="rite-ic"></span><b lang="mr">रस्ता दाखवा</b><i>Find your way to us</i>
            </a>
            <a class="rite" data-rite="knot" data-cal="shaadi" href="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Save the Shaadi date to your calendar">
              <span class="rite-ic"></span><b lang="hi">गाँठ बाँध लीजिए</b><i>Save the date</i>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mangal" class="morsilk" aria-labelledby="mgTitle">
    <div class="specks" id="specks" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="band"><div class="zari"></div><div class="hatch"></div></div>
    <div class="mg-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal"><span lang="mr" class="mr">मंगलाष्टक</span> · Mangalashtak</p>
      <h2 id="mgTitle" class="cal reveal">Two rivers, <span>one blessing</span></h2>
      <div class="verse mr" lang="sa" id="verse"></div>
      <p class="gloss reveal">Ganga, Sindhu, Saraswati, Yamuna, Godavari, Narmada… and the famed Gandaki: may these holy rivers bring you auspiciousness. The Godavari flows through her Maharashtra; the Gandaki through his Bihar.</p>
      <p lang="mr" class="cal savdhan" id="savdhan">॥ शुभमंगल सावधान ॥</p>
    </div>
    <div class="band"><div class="zari"></div><div class="hatch"></div></div>
  </section>

  <div class="curtain">
  <div class="count plate" id="count">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span lang="mr" class="mr">मुहूर्त</span> · the muhurat is in</p>
    <div class="units">
      <div class="unit"><div class="dial"><b id="cd-d">–</b></div><i>days</i></div>
      <div class="unit"><div class="dial"><b id="cd-h">–</b></div><i>hours</i></div>
      <div class="unit"><div class="dial"><b id="cd-m">–</b></div><i>minutes</i></div>
      <div class="unit"><div class="dial"><b id="cd-s">–</b></div><i>seconds</i></div>
    </div>
    <span>Wednesday, 9 December 2026 · 8 in the evening</span>
  </div>
  <section id="rsvp" class="paper" aria-labelledby="rsvpTitle">
    <div class="band"><div class="zari"></div><div class="hatch"></div></div>
    <div class="rsvp">
      <div class="med" data-event="blessing"></div>
      <p class="eyebrow reveal" style="color:var(--deep)"><span lang="hi">उत्तराकांक्षी</span> · awaiting your reply</p>
      <h2 id="rsvpTitle" class="cal letters wave">Will you join us?</h2>
      <p class="reveal" style="margin:0;font-style:italic">[Guest name] family, how many of you will come to each celebration?</p>
      <form id="rsvpForm" class="reveal" novalidate>
        <div class="row"><div class="ev"><b>Haldi</b><i>Tue 8 Dec · 12 noon</i></div><div class="step"><button type="button" data-k="haldi" data-d="-1" aria-label="One fewer guest for Haldi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M6 12h12"/></svg></button><output id="n-haldi">2</output><button type="button" data-k="haldi" data-d="1" aria-label="One more guest for Haldi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M6 12h12M12 6v12"/></svg></button></div></div>
        <div class="row"><div class="ev"><b>Sangeet</b><i>Tue 8 Dec · 8 pm</i></div><div class="step"><button type="button" data-k="sangeet" data-d="-1" aria-label="One fewer guest for Sangeet"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M6 12h12"/></svg></button><output id="n-sangeet">2</output><button type="button" data-k="sangeet" data-d="1" aria-label="One more guest for Sangeet"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M6 12h12M12 6v12"/></svg></button></div></div>
        <div class="row"><div class="ev"><b>Shaadi</b><i>Wed 9 Dec · 8 pm</i></div><div class="step"><button type="button" data-k="shaadi" data-d="-1" aria-label="One fewer guest for Shaadi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M6 12h12"/></svg></button><output id="n-shaadi">2</output><button type="button" data-k="shaadi" data-d="1" aria-label="One more guest for Shaadi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path class="ic" d="M6 12h12M12 6v12"/></svg></button></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="rsvpName">Your name</label><input id="rsvpName" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="[Guest name]"></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="min-height:60px;font-size:1.2rem"><span class="cal" style="font-weight:700">Send RSVP</span>&nbsp;·&nbsp;<span id="total">6</span>&nbsp;guests</button>
        <p class="note" style="margin:0;text-align:center">Prototype: replies aren't sent anywhere yet.</p>
      </form>
      <div class="thanks" id="thanks" hidden>
        <p lang="hi" class="cal dhanyavad">धन्यवाद</p>
        <p class="cal" style="font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;margin:0">Thank you!</p>
        <p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-style:italic">We’ve noted <span id="total2">6</span> guests across the celebrations. See you in Ranchi.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  </div>
</main>

<footer class="plate">
  <div class="band"><div class="zari"></div><div class="hatch"></div></div>
  <div class="foot">
    <p lang="hi" class="chaupai">मंगल भवन अमंगल हारी।<br>द्रवउ सो दसरथ अजिर बिहारी॥</p>
    <p class="cal love">With love, the families of Shreyansh &amp; Mrunalini</p>
    <p class="note" style="color:var(--chuna);margin:0">Motion prototype. The peacocks, feathers and borders are drawn stand-ins; the final art will be commissioned. Reload the page to replay the opening.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  import '../scripts/legacy.js';
</script>
</body>
</html>
